            "review_title": "Review at Vit Huong Binh",
            "review_text": "David Ashbolt\nGold Coast, Australia90 contributions\n0\nAmazing Roast Duck Best Nha Trang Restaurant Local\nDec 2024 • Family\nIf you want an Authentic local Family Experience in Nha Trang look no further than VIT HUONG BINH it is a great family Restaurant serving amazing Roast Duck, Chicken fragrant rice and salad. Traditional Vietnamese cooked with care by Hang in her brand new Oven. It was clean and the food was absolutely delicious. Ask to sit near the amazing Koi Pond and enjoy the best Traditional Roast Duck and rice dish. You won’t be disappointed!!!\nRead more\nWritten December 10, 2024",
